> diff x^(x)
d/dx x^x = x*x^x/x + log(x)*x^x
  holds for x > 0
  check: matches central differences at 100 points (max relative difference 3e-13)
> diff atan(x^2)
d/dx atan(x^2) = 2x/(x^4 + 1)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 2e-15)
> diff log(log(x))
d/dx log(log(x)) = 1/(x*log(x))
  holds for log(x) > 0 and x > 0
  check: matches central differences at 90 points (max relative difference 5e-13)
> diff (x+1)/(x-1)
d/dx (x + 1)/(x - 1) = -2/(x^2 - 2x + 1)
  holds for x != 1
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 1e-11)
> diff sin(x)^2
d/dx sin(x)^2 = 2sin(x)*cos(x)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 3e-14)
> diff exp(-x^2)
d/dx exp(-x^2) = -2x*exp(-x^2)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 1e-15)
> diff x^(1/x)
d/dx x^(1/x) = (x^(1/x) - log(x)*x^(1/x))/x^2
  holds for x > 0
  check: matches central differences at 100 points (max relative difference 4e-15)
